.TH SHB-ENV 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-env \- Manage environment and live secret updates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb env [edit]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Safe live editing of environment secrets. Opens the real .env in $EDITOR (or the legacy vault backup for an active in-place swap session). A running agent session keeps its synthetic copy; restart the session to pick up new values.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb env edit\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
